WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.920
He bet his life savings on the slowest

00:00:02.240 --> 00:00:05.680
horse in the race. The whole betting

00:00:03.920 --> 00:00:07.960
room is laughing at him because all day

00:00:05.680 --> 00:00:09.880
long he hasn't bet a single dollar. He

00:00:07.960 --> 00:00:11.880
just sits by the window smiling because

00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:13.840
he has a mirror. Wait, what's a mirror

00:00:11.880 --> 00:00:15.440
going to do? Well, the racetrack is

00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:16.760
right over the hill from town and his

00:00:15.440 --> 00:00:18.960
buddy is up on that hill with the

00:00:16.760 --> 00:00:20.880
biggest mirror he could find. Race after

00:00:18.960 --> 00:00:22.680
race the favorite wins and the hill

00:00:20.880 --> 00:00:24.160
stays dark. And by the fifth the

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:26.280
regulars are betting on whether he'll

00:00:24.160 --> 00:00:27.960
ever bet. Hey mirror man, maybe try

00:00:26.280 --> 00:00:30.120
wiping it. In the last race the

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:31.800
favorite's so far ahead it's jockey is

00:00:30.120 --> 00:00:33.840
waving [music] to his mom and horse nine

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:36.280
is so far behind it's practically in the

00:00:33.840 --> 00:00:38.240
parking lot. Then the hill flashes and

00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:39.960
he puts every dollar he has on horse

00:00:38.240 --> 00:00:42.200
nine. The guy behind the counter almost

00:00:39.960 --> 00:00:43.885
feels bad taking it. Pal, that horse

00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:45.320
lost a race to the milk cart and it

00:00:43.885 --> 00:00:47.480
[music] was pulling the milk cart. You

00:00:45.320 --> 00:00:49.120
see, back then betting rooms didn't find

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:51.400
out who won until the winner came

00:00:49.120 --> 00:00:53.440
clicking in over a wire and until it did

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:55.200
bets stayed open. Up on that hill his

00:00:53.440 --> 00:00:57.920
buddy just watched horse nine come out

00:00:55.200 --> 00:00:59.480
of nowhere and steal it by a nose. So,

00:00:57.920 --> 00:01:01.320
while the room is still laughing the

00:00:59.480 --> 00:01:03.320
wire starts clicking and by the time it

00:01:01.320 --> 00:01:05.920
spells out nine nobody's laughing

00:01:03.320 --> 00:01:05.920
anymore.

